  <li><strong><a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry">Aspect Cabinetry</a></strong> — Semi-custom value for new construction and builder projects.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">Eclipse Cabinetry</a></strong> — Frameless, full-access cabinetry for contemporary remodels.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm German Kitchens</a></strong> — Handleless European fronts for high-end Broadmoor-area homes, with protected territory and strong dealer margins.</li>
